WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:02.800
<i>It is the 25th year of the Taisho Era.</i>

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:06.610
<i>All preceding events have 
converged at Nachtigal.</i>

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:08.800
<i>Everyone's emotions blend together,</i>

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.740
<i>becoming a swirling flame 
that disappears into the sky.</i>

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:14.910
<i>This is the story of Kuze 
Tsugumi and her return.</i>

00:01:57.850 --> 00:01:58.630
Akira!

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:02.410
This will be the end of Karasu.

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:04.640
Let's turn him in.

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:10.150
Kagutsuchi?

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:15.150
Setting fire to my workshop 
was quite an ambitious move

00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:18.530
for a lowly student like you.

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:23.660
Professor Mozuyama, I will never 
forgive you for what you've done.

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:25.790
I will hand you over to the police!

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:27.910
Utter rubbish.

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:29.420
Kagutsuchi is serious!

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:33.170
We know all about the 
despicable things you've done.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:36.250
Using dangerous cursed tomes and drugs,

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:39.430
you made test subjects of many
Imperial Capital University students

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:41.300
and caused their deaths!

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:43.610
That is the work of a demon!

00:02:43.610 --> 00:02:45.510
You offend me.

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:48.810
<i>I'm</i> not responsible for the 
deaths of those students.

00:02:49.070 --> 00:02:51.750
They simply lacked the proper qualities.

00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:52.500
Shut up!

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:56.550
When my cursed tomes are read by 
those with the right qualities,

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:58.520
they are mentally stimulated

00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:02.570
and demonstrate abilities beyond
those of an average person.

00:03:02.790 --> 00:03:11.460
My goal is to guide as many as possible
to a more advanced form of humanity.

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:13.460
You're insane.

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:16.960
I am as sane as they come.

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:23.970
Mother, Father, and Child

00:03:21.650 --> 00:03:23.970
-Bond-

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:30.150
Master!

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:34.610
No need to worry. I'll be back soon.

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:39.020
Take Shouko back to the main 
house and wait for me there.

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:43.020
Keep walking!

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:47.490
You're going to tell us everything 
you know, so be ready.

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:50.240
That just leaves Professor Mozuyama...

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:54.000
He should definitely still be
somewhere in the building.

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:56.180
Rui!

00:03:56.180 --> 00:03:57.720
Hey, Kuze!

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:03.300
Professor Mozuyama, you're coming with me.

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:06.000
How surprising.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:09.480
Are my ideals that indecipherable to you

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:13.140
because you've been influenced 
by your father, Sagisawa Keiichi?

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:18.520
Sagisawa was a classmate of mine in college,

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:21.570
so I knew him very well.

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:24.240
I even know that his wife, Miyako-san,

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:29.250
was unable to bear his children due to
a disease that had once afflicted her.

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:33.280
That's right, you are not 
their biological child.

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:36.360
You were adopted from elsewhere.

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:40.010
I don't need you to tell me that. I already knew.

00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:44.000
But why exactly does that matter?

00:04:44.490 --> 00:04:48.680
I have no other parents 
but the late Sagisawas.

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:51.950
Is that so?

00:04:51.950 --> 00:04:57.820
Perhaps if you knew who your real 
parents were, you might change your mind.

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:00.190
I won't.

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:01.900
You think so?

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:04.450
I will tell you, then.

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:06.700
It's me.

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:12.370
I am your real father!

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:16.720
And the mother who gave birth to you

00:05:17.070 --> 00:05:21.870
is the noble and beautiful Shouko-san!

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:27.560
No! Someone help me!

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:27.560
Shouko-san!

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:29.850
Help me!

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:35.850
My dear child...

00:05:36.210 --> 00:05:39.390
You're my precious baby.

00:05:39.390 --> 00:05:43.940
Be happy, be happy, be happy.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:49.560
No! Please!

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:51.290
Give him back, Father!

00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:54.730
Did you really think a daughter 
of the Higashikouji house

00:05:54.730 --> 00:05:57.870
would be forgiven for bearing 
a child out of wedlock?

00:05:58.410 --> 00:06:00.570
You never had a child!

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:03.930
Give me back my baby!

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:10.150
<i>Young miss, I will raise your 
baby with my husband.</i>

00:06:10.150 --> 00:06:14.400
<i>We will treasure him as though 
he were our own, I promise!</i>

00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:19.460
<i>Your marriage has been decided. 
You will wed Shiginuma Takashi...</i>

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:22.150
My baby...

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:24.980
<i>My...</i>

00:06:28.250 --> 00:06:29.150
Hisui!

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:31.330
Hey, you okay?

00:06:32.340 --> 00:06:34.030
I got careless.

00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:36.700
Please capture Professor Mozuyama.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:38.910
He ran up from there.

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:40.540
Up?

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:41.790
Hurry!

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:44.470
Hayato, Kuze, I'll leave that to you.

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:47.100
I'll get Hisui out of here.

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:51.800
Shut up... Shut up! Shut up!

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:56.810
There's absolutely no way
that <i>you</i> are my father!

00:06:57.160 --> 00:07:00.590
Rui, come and join me.

00:07:00.590 --> 00:07:03.120
We can combine our power as father and son,

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:07.320
and lead humanity to a glorious future!

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:10.330
Quiet! I've had enough!

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:13.070
You don't deserve to live!

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:21.580
You should know how incredibly valuable 
my research is to the future of humanity.

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:27.700
Sagisawa Keiichi was too foolish and 
mediocre to understand it at all.

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:28.340
Shut up!

00:07:28.570 --> 00:07:31.080
And then, of all things,

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:37.970
he branded my research as criminal 
and tried to have me prosecuted.

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:40.910
It would have been a tremendous problem

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:45.220
had he interfered with my precious 
research due to such a shallow mindset,

00:07:45.220 --> 00:07:49.960
so I slipped him and Miyako-san
a bit of my medicine.

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:54.240
I knew it. That accident was your doing!

00:07:54.710 --> 00:07:57.740
You bastard! You murdered my parents!

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:06.180
Make no mistake.

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:14.800
I will continue to advance 
this research further,

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:20.640
and it will show us what humanity should be, 
leading to new and wonderful heights!

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:33.400
You are...

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:35.410
Shouko-san!

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:39.540
You've come to run away 
with me, haven't you?

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:42.860
You do love me after all!

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:45.790
I knew you would be here.

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:50.050
You have only ever cared 
about protecting yourself,

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:53.420
and believed nothing mattered 
except what was good for you.

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:57.370
Sh-Shouko-san?

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:58.680
I'm sorry.

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:02.430
I decided that I would be 
the one to kill this man.

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:07.000
Sh-Shouko-san? What are you saying...

00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:12.910
Th-Th-This is a misunderstanding, Shouko-san!

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:17.880
Damn this thing... Here, see? As you can tell,

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:20.950
I have no intention of harming anyone.

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:23.940
You are a kind person.

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:25.010
Kind?

00:09:25.010 --> 00:09:26.330
Yes!

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:28.880
You are beautiful and merciful!

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:31.340
You should be trying to save me!

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:35.090
Me? Save you?

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:38.820
Have you forgotten about that rainy night?

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:41.850
I cried out over and over 
for someone to help me.

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:48.840
N-N-No! You responded to my love back then.

00:09:48.840 --> 00:09:52.730
And that's why you bore my child!

00:09:53.810 --> 00:09:56.130
He is not your child.

00:09:56.130 --> 00:10:01.090
He is <i>my</i> precious and dear 
child, and mine alone.

00:10:01.850 --> 00:10:05.870
I don't know anyone else like you.

00:10:06.190 --> 00:10:09.370
You are vulgar and cowardly, 
boorish and a brute.

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:12.380
D-Don't say that, Shouko-san.

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:16.630
W-W-W-W-W-W-Wait!

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:20.810
I've waited so long for this moment.

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:40.420
Th-The hot air balloon...

00:10:40.420 --> 00:10:44.030
My hot air balloon is burning...

00:10:49.020 --> 00:10:49.540
Wha—

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:53.790
W-Wait...

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:56.300
Th-This can't be happening!

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:11.530
Thank you for saving me.

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:16.070
I didn't save you because of who you are.

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:20.470
My mother was the departed Sagisawa Miyako.

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:22.450
Yes, of course.

00:11:23.930 --> 00:11:24.810
I wonder...

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:28.450
Do you like kaleidoscopes?

00:11:30.310 --> 00:11:35.570
Yes. The things you see constantly 
change and turn as you look at them.

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:38.240
I'm drawn to that.

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:38.960
I see.

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:44.200
I used to think that I hated kaleidoscopes,

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:48.470
since the most beautiful shapes 
never return a second time.

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:56.100
But now, I realize that I might 
not actually hate that.

00:11:56.730 --> 00:12:02.490
After all, you might see an even more 
beautiful shape one day, right?

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:04.490
Yes.

00:12:06.110 --> 00:12:07.680
Farewell.

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:11.500
I hope you'll be happy, Rui.

00:12:15.650 --> 00:12:16.880
Goodbye.

00:12:23.830 --> 00:12:24.940
Rui!

00:12:26.270 --> 00:12:27.390
It's over.

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:28.780
You...

00:12:31.650 --> 00:12:33.020
Don't worry.

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:36.520
I won't burn any more books.

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:38.290
Rui...

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:55.040
Tokimiya-san!

00:12:58.910 --> 00:13:00.920
I'm so glad you're all right!

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:02.170
Thank you.

00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:05.440
Goodness, you had us all so worried.

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:07.680
I know. I'm sorry.

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:11.010
The mission has been successfully completed.

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:14.810
Yes, you all did so well.

00:13:17.840 --> 00:13:19.310
Wait, Akira.

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:20.820
Where are you going?

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:25.700
I've... done something 
completely unforgivable.

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:27.490
Akira...

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:31.580
If it's so unforgivable, then atone
for it until it <i>is</i> forgivable.

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:33.120
But...

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:35.560
Fukurou needs you.

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:36.580
Kougami!

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:38.790
Just come back!

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:42.010
You're on cleaning duty tomorrow.

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:43.710
Don't think you're getting out of it.

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:44.860
Ukai...

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:47.450
Akira!

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:49.850
O-Ozaki?!

00:13:51.870 --> 00:13:57.640
If you ever just disappear like that 
again, I'll never forgive you!

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:01.860
Let's call it even for now—

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:06.110
Um...

00:14:07.350 --> 00:14:08.610
You overdid it.

00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:16.780
Those two are such good friends.

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:19.980
A-Are they?

00:14:18.010 --> 00:14:20.590
Hey, that was quite a punch, Akira.

00:14:20.590 --> 00:14:22.890
Same goes for you, Hayato.

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:22.890
That's just how they are.

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:24.100
I see.

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:33.010
Damn it... Damn it!

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:36.280
Those bastards... Just you wait!

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:39.140
What's this? A book?

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:40.520
A book?!

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:45.670
I must return...

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:52.180
I must return to the flames...

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:55.540
I must return to the flames...

00:14:56.090 --> 00:14:59.260
I must return to the flames...

00:15:13.280 --> 00:15:15.510
Good work, everyone.

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:19.520
Enjoy yourselves to the fullest today.

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:34.260
We haven't had sushi since 
Kuze's welcome party.

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:37.890
It feels a bit strange.

00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:42.170
That seems like such a long time ago.

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:45.420
It also feels like it was just the other day.

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:52.050
Uh, Ukai-kun, you weren't here for that.

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:55.050
I-It was a joke! My best one!

00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:57.060
A joke?

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:01.040
And what a splendid joke 
it was, young master!

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:02.690
Don't call me that!

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:04.070
Seriously...

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:08.050
Are your wounds doing better?

00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:11.580
Thanks. I wasn't badly hurt, so it's all right.

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:13.950
I'm very glad to hear that.

00:16:14.330 --> 00:16:16.780
With such a big case wrapped up,

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:20.550
all of you and the princess
can return to normal now.

00:16:21.180 --> 00:16:21.960
Indeed.

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:37.360
Sushi is best eaten with everyone, isn't it?

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:37.970
Yes!

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:52.490
What on earth is wrong?

00:16:53.670 --> 00:16:58.200
Regarding your sister and 
Shiori's husband Yasuhiko,

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:01.870
we have figured out who 
caused both their deaths.

00:17:02.110 --> 00:17:03.120
Huh?

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:08.520
The letter sent to Yoshikiri-kun tipped us off.

00:17:08.520 --> 00:17:10.130
Remember what Kuze-kun told us?

00:17:10.470 --> 00:17:13.630
The aura yesterday almost looked like flames.

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:18.360
Nabari-kun also said that the 
cursed tomes from your sister

00:17:18.360 --> 00:17:22.350
and Yasuhiko's cases had flame-like auras.

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:24.890
However, he said the color was different.

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:29.900
Just in case, we had Kuze-kun 
also take a look at them.

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:34.950
She said they were the same 
color and the same flames.

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:37.370
Just like the cursed tome 
from Hitaki-kun's incident,

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:40.910
and just like the letter 
addressed to Yoshikiri-kun.

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:44.070
But then, Nabari-san...

00:17:45.470 --> 00:17:46.290
You can't mean...

00:17:48.810 --> 00:17:52.800
As I examined the handwriting of each 
of the cursed tomes by using a mirror

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:57.800
so that I wouldn't be affected by them,

00:17:57.800 --> 00:18:01.110
I noticed they shared 
several common features.

00:18:01.780 --> 00:18:06.310
I came to the conclusion that they 
were written by the same person.

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:15.980
And those features apparently match 
up with Nabari-san's handwriting.

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:25.540
What a surprise. I can't believe 
Hitaki is already being discharged.

00:18:26.060 --> 00:18:29.590
He's doing better than
the doctor predicted, then.

00:18:29.590 --> 00:18:31.080
That's a good thing.

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:33.190
You're right about that.

00:18:34.150 --> 00:18:41.090
But Hitaki and Gramps will be even more 
pleased that you're coming back with me.

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:45.600
I was thinking that I should stop 
by for a visit sooner or later.

00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:49.860
And it's not just the handwriting.

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:52.110
The names of the authors of the three books,

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:57.730
Nozaki Youji, Nemoto 
Yasushi, and Nagumo Yoshiyuki,

00:18:57.730 --> 00:19:00.490
all have the initials "Y.N."

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:05.240
Nabari Yutaka... His initials are Y.N.!

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:07.040
Correct.

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:13.500
And he has some trauma relating to an 
incident with fire from when he was a child.

00:19:13.740 --> 00:19:18.510
After his father was killed in action, 
he apparently lost his mother in a fire.

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:23.010
The flame-like auras... The suicides by fire...

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:25.800
Yes. We don't have any proof,

00:19:25.800 --> 00:19:29.330
but the possibility of Nabari-san 
being the author is quite high.

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:34.520
We're heading to his home right now.

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:38.940
Welcome home, Tsugumi-sama.

00:19:39.960 --> 00:19:43.280
You are also very welcome, Nabari-sama.

00:19:43.640 --> 00:19:45.780
It has been quite some time, Ouchi-san.

00:19:46.610 --> 00:19:48.580
Nee-san!

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:50.540
Hitaki!

00:19:55.350 --> 00:19:57.550
Nee-san! I missed you!

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:01.050
Congratulations on being discharged, Hitaki.

00:20:02.400 --> 00:20:06.820
Now, I'll go put on some tea.
Please wait just a bit.

00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:10.310
Pancakes too, please, Gramps!

00:20:10.910 --> 00:20:13.230
Yes, as you wish.

00:20:14.420 --> 00:20:17.410
It's been so long, Nabari-san.

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:19.820
You always used to play with me.

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:24.070
Yes, but you've grown so much.

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:28.830
This all brings back so many memories.

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:33.580
There's quite a bit less furniture 
than there was back then, though.

00:20:34.360 --> 00:20:35.610
That's true,

00:20:35.610 --> 00:20:42.840
but so long as the master, mistress, 
and you two are all well, I'm happy.

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:45.090
Nabari-san...

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:50.600
That reminds me. About the cursed 
tome that hurt Hitaki-kun...

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:54.350
It was a book from the library here, right?

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:55.730
Yes.

00:20:55.730 --> 00:21:00.000
Actually, when I went into 
the library in the past,

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:03.490
I was almost able to see several auras.

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:04.610
What?

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:11.370
My abilities were still weak at the time, 
so I thought perhaps I'd been mistaken.

00:21:11.780 --> 00:21:14.500
By several, you mean 
there could still be others?

00:21:14.880 --> 00:21:16.870
I could have just been seeing things...

00:21:17.700 --> 00:21:19.630
We should take a look right away!

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:20.950
You're right.

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:29.010
Could one of these be a cursed tome?

00:21:32.300 --> 00:21:35.500
Nee-san, what does an aura look like?

00:21:37.610 --> 00:21:40.520
It's so bright that it's 
almost hard to look at.

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:44.100
I don't see anything that 
looks like an aura, though...

00:21:44.100 --> 00:21:46.030
Nee-san, look carefully.

00:21:49.390 --> 00:21:51.700
Ah, I'm so glad.

00:21:52.180 --> 00:21:55.160
I was hoping to get just 
the three of us together.

00:21:55.400 --> 00:21:56.410
What?

00:21:56.850 --> 00:22:00.750
Remember? I have no home to go back to.

00:22:01.940 --> 00:22:06.460
But now... with the two of you here, it feels like I can finally go back...

00:22:07.290 --> 00:22:10.140
to my home in the flames.

00:23:20.420 --> 00:23:22.020
<i>This is Ozaki Hayato.</i>

00:23:21.080 --> 00:23:36.430
Chapter 12:  "Bewitching Tales of the Imperial Capital -Nil Admirari-"

00:23:22.020 --> 00:23:25.710
<i>Honestly, I haven't been 
able to accept all this yet,</i>

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:27.950
<i>but that doesn't matter.</i>

00:23:27.950 --> 00:23:30.200
<i>I want to rush to you as fast as I can.</i>

00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:31.930
<i>Wait for me.</i>

00:23:31.930 --> 00:23:35.280
<i>Whatever happens, I will protect you!</i>

00:23:35.280 --> 00:23:39.050
<i>I still have something I haven't 
been able to tell you!</i>
